data: {"id": "e38e3d7113904a44-final", "run_id": "e38e3d7113904a44", "seq": 1166, "ts_ms": 1788441918590, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` | CrashLoopBackOff | {'message': 'k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks-status:'} |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` | `status: Running` (Pod层面)；Container `app` 退出码 2，重启次数 21 | 确认 Pod 已调度并处于运行状态，但容器反复崩溃 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubelet | `BackOff restarting failed container app` (4m42s, x384 over 89m) | 直接证实容器因异常退出触发指数退避重启机制 |\n| 3 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason=Error`；`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=CrashLoopBackOff` | 确认容器最近一次终止原因为 Error，当前处于等待/崩溃循环中 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 4 次重复 `http_request` 错误日志：`\"message\": \"runtime process exiting\"`, `\"http_status\": 500`, `\"path\": \"/work\"`，时间窗口 12:58-13:19 | 定位故障触发点为 HTTP `/work` 请求处理期间的内部崩溃 |\n| 5 | Logging | Elasticsearch | 4 次重复 `http_request` 成功日志：`\"http_status\": 200`, `\"path\": \"/work\"`，时间窗口 12:58-13:19，`allocated_mib`: 0 | 确认 `/work` 路径同时存在成功与失败情况，资源分配为 0（未体现 OOM 或资源耗尽特征） |\n| 6 | Tracing | Tempo/Deepflow | Flow: `GET /work` 返回 500，持续 4.5-9.8ms；Trace ID 与错误日志匹配（如 `75598d...`） | 从网络与调用链角度验证 500 错误确实由应用层在处理该请求时返回 |\n\n**证据综合说明**：Kubernetes 状态与事件确认了容器因非零退出码（2）频繁崩溃。日志与 Trace 事实互相印证，指出崩溃直接发生在处理 `/work` 路径的 HTTP 请求期间，且应用明确输出了 \"runtime process exiting\" 消息。Metric 数据与资源配置（Request 24Mi / Limit 96Mi）一致，未体现 OOM 特征。日志中的 `allocated_mib: 0` 结合退出码 2 暗示该资源数值可能为应用层自行管理或未正确上报，而非 Kubernetes 层面的资源限制问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用层内部异常 (未确认具体类型) → 处理 GET /work 时返回 500 并触发 \"runtime process exiting\" → 容器进程强制退出 (Exit Code 2) → Pod 进入 CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**部分确认的根因**：\n应用进程在处理 `/work` HTTP 请求时发生了未捕获的严重错误（表现为 HTTP 500 和 \"runtime process exiting\" 日志），导致容器主进程非正常退出（Exit Code 2），从而引发 Kubernetes 的重启循环 [证据 #4, #5, #6]。\n\n**证据不足/未确认环节**：\n- **具体异常类型**：现有日志未提供堆栈跟踪或异常详情，无法区分是代码逻辑 Bug、依赖服务超时还是参数错误。\n- **资源监控/管理**：日志中 `allocated_mib` 始终为 0 且退出码非 OOM 常见代码，无法确认是否为资源未被正确监控或应用层自行管理了资源，缺乏决定性事实以排除或证实内存/资源相关的根因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 67.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 67.9s (Evidence 58.3s, RCA 9.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 97.387, "metrics": {"run_id": "e38e3d7113904a44", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 97.3900556564331, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 97390.0556564331, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 92382.18426704407, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 6, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 12154.285192489624, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4425.961494445801}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16894.034147262573, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 67871.28901481628, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 12594.82717514038, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

